## Key Design Decisions

| Aspect | Value | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **Background gradient** | `#0f0f1e → #1a1a2e` | Deep dark blue-black, avoids pure black |
| **Particle colors** | `#00d4ff`, `#a78bfa`, `#10b981` | Cyan, Purple, Emerald — high contrast on dark |
| **Particle count** | 50 | Balanced density without performance hit |
| **Connection distance** | 150px | Close enough for a web/constellation feel |
| **Trail effect** | `rgba(15,15,30, 0.1)` fill | 10% opacity clear = ghosting/motion trails |
| **Glass card** | `blur(20px) saturate(180%)` | Frosted glass with color pop |
| **Star border speed** | `6s` | Slow enough to be premium, fast enough to notice |
| **Font** | Geist (Google Fonts) | Modern, clean sans-serif |
